> Hi - I recently found this package and am evaluating if I should use an
> upcoming DES project to learn it.  I will give a generic overview of the
> simulation I want to develop, please let me know if the nuances are possible
> in simmer.
>
> Essentially, it is a simulation of the movement of three types of bags
> through a retail store - typeA, typeB, and typeC.  The trajectories for each
> bag type would be very similar:
>
> arrival - appearance at a counter due to a purchase occurring
> seizure of a store employee
> bags spend X minutes being moved to a storage area specific for that bag
> type, each storage area with their own max capacity
> release of a store employee
> bags wait a specified Y minutes (storage area dwell time)
> seizure of a store employee
> retrieved from the storage area for Z minutes
> release of a store employee
